<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70968" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμ-ισμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything sanctioned by current</i> or <i>established
				usage, custom,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλληνικὸν ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					269
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1471
			</span></i>; <i>institution,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν γὰρ ἀνθρώποισιν οἷον ἄργυρος
					κακὸν ν. ἔβλαστε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					296
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὶ ἡμῖν ν. οὐκ ἔστι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					248
				</span></i>
			, with a play on signf. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i> (do not <i>pass current</i> with us). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> esp. <i>current coin,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. κόψαι</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόψασθαι,</span> coin <i>money,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.166
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἀρχαῖον ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					720
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. σύμβολον τῆς ἀλλαγῆς ἕνεκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					371b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1133b11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1257a11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				6.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάλαντα νομίσματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					3.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ἡμεδαποῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.91.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐπιχώριον ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					21.12
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>: pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νομίσματα</span>”
				<i>pieces of money, coins,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					1.9.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>full legal measure,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ χοῶς ἢ τῶν κοτυλῶν τὸ ν.
					διαλυμαίνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					348
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
